{"q":"2","t":"Add Two Numbers","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>You are given two <strong>non-empty</strong> linked lists representing two non-negative integers. The digits are stored in <strong>reverse order</strong>, and each of their nodes contains a single digit. Add the two numbers and return the sum&nbsp;as a linked list.</p>\n\n<p>You may assume the two numbers do not contain any leading zero, except the number 0 itself.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/348067960d149ef7.jpg\" style=\"width: 483px; height: 342px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> l1 = [2,4,3], l2 = [5,6,4]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [7,0,8]\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> 342 + 465 = 807.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> l1 = [0], l2 = [0]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [0]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> l1 = [9,9,9,9,9,9,9], l2 = [9,9,9,9]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [8,9,9,9,0,0,0,1]\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in each linked list is in the range <code>[1, 100]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 9</code></li>\n\t<li>It is guaranteed that the list represents a number that does not have leading zeros.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"addTwoNumbers\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"l1\",\r\n      \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n      \"dealloc\": false\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"l2\",\r\n      \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n      \"dealloc\": false\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n    \"dealloc\": true\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Linked List","slug":"linked-list"},{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Recursion","slug":"recursion"}],"s":[{"t":"Multiply Strings","s":"multiply-strings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Add Binary","s":"add-binary","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Sum of Two Integers","s":"sum-of-two-integers","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Add Strings","s":"add-strings","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Add Two Numbers II","s":"add-two-numbers-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Add to Array-Form of Integer","s":"add-to-array-form-of-integer","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Add Two Polynomials Represented as Linked Lists","s":"add-two-polynomials-represented-as-linked-lists","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Double a Number Represented as a Linked List","s":"double-a-number-represented-as-a-linked-list","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Cisco","cisco"],["Apple","apple"],["IBM","ibm"],["Zoho","zoho"],["tcs","tcs"],["Yandex","yandex"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["ByteDance","bytedance"],["Uber","uber"],["Adobe","adobe"],["Airbnb","airbnb"],["Wix","wix"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",61],["Amazon","amazon",29],["Microsoft","microsoft",17],["Meta","facebook",13],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",7]],"b":[["tcs","tcs",2],["Palo Alto Networks","palo-alto-networks",2],["Jane Street","jane-street",2]],"m":[["Apple","apple",5],["Oracle","oracle",5],["Zoho","zoho",5],["Yandex","yandex",5],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",4],["Cisco","cisco",4],["Nvidia","nvidia",4],["Capital One","capital-one",4],["Infosys","infosys",3],["Adobe","adobe",3]]}}